      "name": "Aura of Growth",
      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "aura",
        "plant",
        "primal"
      ],
      "text": "120 feet. Plants near Dimari-Diji grow larger and more vibrant. Plants in the emanation gain the success effects of the Plant Growth ritual. Any plant spells cast in the area are empowered and use the effects of the spell 1 rank higher than it was cast, to a maximum of 9th rank (Dimari-Diji's spells are unaffected). Finally, other plant creatures gain fast healing 20 while in the area.\n\nEffect: Aura of Growth",
